          "event": "framed-resolved",
          "data": {
            "method": "kit"
          }
        }
      ],
      "journal": "You left Duggan in his crate and took his planting kit: a hammer, a punch and one nervous stamp. It was proof enough with the ledger, and Vane has had to answer for the brass."
    }
  ]
}
